{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "656ac064d304790ae25a708d08c46c3c073cce649f96868a86b644cf807bbab5", "ja": "お、紬、衣装チェックか。\n探偵衣装、何か気になるところはないか？", "zh": "哦，䌷，你在检查服装啊。\n侦探服装有没有什么奇怪的地方？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "fe228a347c1e7163eed4d8ed7bd193f019bde8a4fe1c1d54fdc9e72ed37d1d3a", "ja": "気になるところ……？", "zh": "奇怪的地方……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1002_051tmg", "source_sha256": "32c8c4b0d128ef9c6a9f84a486c69a24d849b8c3dd4c40406d2698c82d99dfcc", "ja": "つまり、探偵ならこの衣装に隠されたメッセージに\n気付いてみせろ……、などということですか？", "zh": "你的意思是，如果我是侦探，\n就必须把藏在这套服装里的讯息找出来……是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d8b070bc795972a1d9285c42c06ccd3153237d5fee33cfadc9dd241089aa9cb7", "ja": "いや、そんな凝った仕掛けは別に……。ただ衣装の\n着心地とか、デザインの感想を聞いただけだよ。", "zh": "不，我没有做那么精细的手脚……我只是想问你\n穿起来舒不舒服，还有对设计的感想而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d87049b956e5b400eb45f70d5b3066039f8bcff7e79d6687aba660c22bd98a9f", "ja": "そうでしたか……。わかりました。\n着心地は、とてもいいです。", "zh": "原来是这样……我知道了。\n穿起来非常舒适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1005_051tmg", "source_sha256": "b17215b9d2309770b57abe9330f9d53b6c15d6bdcbb95baf523fc720f3400642", "ja": "私が自分で選ぶ服とはかなり違いますが、だからこそ\n目新しいというか。不思議と心も浮き立ちます。", "zh": "这套服装跟我平时的穿着风格差异很大，\n因此让我感到十分耳目一新，内心也有股莫名的雀跃感。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1006_p", "source_sha256": "375f15a69671c759bc3984807dbfbb0168b56da2207003f2d5af22420674677e", "ja": "なるほど、紬は普段、おしとやかな格好だからな。\nでも、気に入ったならよかったよ。", "zh": "原来如此，毕竟䌷平常的穿着一向很端庄嘛。\n不过，你喜欢就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "73f19ca2a24cbdb82c0bda55ada52a9d1086885c8a1d0e762239a583a479774c", "ja": "はい。このお衣装に見合う振る舞いを、\nしっかりできるようになればと。", "zh": "是的，我希望自己的言行举止\n能够配得上这套服装。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "4b0f64ff1aeaa46f327b89c788121273c561e4b4a7fe23cb95b34e654790a257", "ja": "ただ、少し問題というか……。着慣れないせいか、\n着こなせているのかどうか、確信が持てません。", "zh": "可是，该说是有点问题吗……可能是因为还穿不习惯，\n所以我无法确定自己穿起来合不合适。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1009_051tmg", "source_sha256": "7d0eeb979fd876f4a0a7e95ebef7ad7cb62e65cd2df836d80da75563c2fbe8e0", "ja": "{$P$}。私はこの探偵衣装を、\nきちんと着こなせていますか？", "zh": "{$P$}，这套侦探服装，\n我穿起来还可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_1010", "source_sha256": "a33967b3fe4d92e08113bb6ad7b15b47c8ffb5fa8f47144c1b5e5c56e5d51720", "ja": "もちろん", "zh": "当然", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_2000_p", "source_sha256": "c58852750a934aae5a13caae21ba0bada7ce1e3aad33b8bc54ba1552c613984f", "ja": "もちろん、ばっちり着こなせてる。\nよく似合ってるよ。", "zh": "当然了，你穿起来非常好看。\n很适合你喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_2001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "40b2fdc574be848c1663edb01f106ea5abe4ae713c391c42e9ad7ff1603c3206", "ja": "本当ですか？　探偵らしく見えますか？", "zh": "真的吗？看起来有没有侦探的风范？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_2002_p", "source_sha256": "4fda6280732133ae07e50325830d0f6393bf77f87771b0d0ee42aaf0ebcf20e9", "ja": "ああ、紬らしく凛として清楚だけど、\n芯の強そうな、立派な探偵に見える。", "zh": "有啊，服装很有䌷凛然清秀的风格，而当䌷穿上它后，\n看起来就像一名坚毅耿直的出色侦探。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_2003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "902e94936c94a2873f8693f17109ab11f598448372b031fe0ed4bf9270b176f4", "ja": "……っ。", "zh": "……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_2004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "302fc27212243af37f749542bee2f4556293f615aeac25febdc28cea25ae2724", "ja": "た、探偵らしく見えるのなら、それでいいのです。\nよ、よけいなこと……いわんでも……。", "zh": "既、既然看起来有侦探风范，那就好。\n你不、不用说其他……多、多余的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_2005_p", "source_sha256": "79149dcce46b9bba36383facbdcdfb83f691ba54c71462345540cfc32fd1026b", "ja": "……そうか、ごめんごめん。\nとにかく、自信をもって大丈夫ってことだ！", "zh": "……这样啊，抱歉抱歉。\n总之我的意思是，你可以更有自信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_2006_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9f000f9af3b0ae3ff7310043aafba9b31e7d521ef91c7af85286d6eff3d9a50f", "ja": "……はい。でしたら、よいのです。\nでしたら……よいのです、が……。", "zh": "……好的，若是那样就好。\n若是那样……就好，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_051tmg0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_051tmg0094_2007_051tmg", "source_sha256": "d3cc398a65b88eaaf06919aa66cf24878f013e3dfb4f56a49eae3d9b66a88643", "ja": "あの……。\nもっと着こなせるよう、頑張ります。", "zh": "那个……\n我会努力将它穿得更好看的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
